      "decision": "retainNote",
      "finding": "The complete target zayin head runs into a narrow shaft, with a small uneven lower-head shoulder. Plain זָהָב and בִּזְרוֹעוֹתָיו have comparable head-to-shaft narrowing and irregularities. Pointed הַזָּהָב has a distinct additional medial left node below the head; same-source וּלְחַזֵּק on page224 has a side point projecting from the shaft toward the following qoph. The target has no independently distinguishable extra node, but this does not prove source absence. Keep the dagesh disclosure.",
